[
  {
    "label": "MIN",
    "note": "水の構造最適化。Gaussian連携時のメモリとプロセッサ数はGauMemとGauProcで指定します。",
    "source": "https://afir.sci.hokudai.ac.jp/manual/grrm17/conventional-calculations/grrm17_10.html",
    "lines": [
      "# MIN/wB97XD/6-31G(d)",
      "",
      "0 1",
      "O  0.000  0.000  0.000",
      "H  0.758  0.000  0.504",
      "H -0.758  0.000  0.504",
      "Options",
      "GauMem = 800",
      "GauProc = 4"
    ]
  },
  {
    "label": "AFIRMIN",
    "note": "人工力を課したポテンシャル面（AFIR関数）上での最適化。",
    "source": "https://afir.sci.hokudai.ac.jp/manual/grrm17/path-search-by-artificial-force-induced-reaction-method/grrm17_32.html",
    "lines": [
      "# MIN/B3LYP/6-31G",
      "",
      "0 1",
      "C  2.213 -0.881 -2.514",
      "O  2.809 -0.813 -1.448",
      "H  2.747 -1.167 -3.431",
      "H  1.138 -0.661 -2.585",
      "N  1.923 -3.026 -1.769",
      "H  2.408 -3.288 -0.913",
      "H  2.465 -3.430 -2.529",
      "H  1.043 -3.537 -1.755",
      "Options",
      "AddInteraction",
      "GAMMA = 200.0",
      "Fragm.1 = 1",
      "Fragm.2 = 2",
      "Fragm.3 = 5",
      "Fragm.4 = 6",
      "1 2",
      "3 4",
      "END",
      "NOFC",
      "KeepIntFiles",
      "GauMem = 800",
      "GauProc = 4"
    ]
  },
  {
    "label": "FREQ",
    "note": "ホルムアルデヒドの調和振動解析。実計算では同じ計算レベルで最適化した座標を使います。",
    "source": "https://afir.sci.hokudai.ac.jp/manual/grrm17/conventional-calculations/grrm17_11.html",
    "lines": [
      "# FREQ/MP2/6-31G(d)",
      "",
      "0 1",
      "C  0.000  0.000  0.000",
      "O  0.000  0.000  1.258",
      "H  0.934  0.000 -0.582",
      "H -0.934  0.000 -0.582",
      "Options",
      "GauMem = 2000",
      "GauProc = 8",
      "Temperature = 298.15",
      "Pressure = 1.0"
    ]
  },
  {
    "label": "SADDLE",
    "note": "ホルムアルデヒドの異性化に対する遷移状態最適化。初期座標はマニュアルの最適化結果を丸めた近似構造です。",
    "source": "https://afir.sci.hokudai.ac.jp/manual/grrm17/conventional-calculations/grrm17_13.html",
    "lines": [
      "# SADDLE/M062X/6-31+G(d)",
      "",
      "0 1",
      "C  0.000  0.000  0.000",
      "O  0.000  0.000  1.378",
      "H  1.020  0.000 -0.442",
      "H -1.039  0.000  0.832",
      "Options",
      "GauMem = 2000",
      "GauProc = 8"
    ]
  },
  {
    "label": "SC-AFIR",
    "note": "ホルムアルデヒドと硫酸分子の反応経路探索。フラグメントはGRRMが生成し、GAMMAはkJ/molの単位で指定します。",
    "source": "https://afir.sci.hokudai.ac.jp/manual/grrm17/path-search-by-artificial-force-induced-reaction-method/grrm17_34.html",
    "lines": [
      "# SC-AFIR/B3LYP/6-31G(d)",
      "",
      "0 1",
      "C  2.213 -0.881 -2.514",
      "O  2.809 -0.813 -1.448",
      "H  2.747 -1.167 -3.431",
      "H  1.138 -0.661 -2.585",
      "S  0.139 -0.244  0.945",
      "O -0.340  0.676  1.959",
      "O -0.436 -0.276 -0.396",
      "O  1.716 -0.053  0.844",
      "H  2.078 -0.363 -0.051",
      "O -0.023 -1.709  1.627",
      "H  0.129 -2.417  0.968",
      "Options",
      "AddInteraction",
      "GAMMA = 200.0",
      "Target = 1-4,8-11",
      "END",
      "AddUniversalForce = 50.0",
      "UniversalForceTarget = 1-4,8-11",
      "ReadBareEnergy",
      "END",
      "NOFC",
      "KeepLUPPath",
      "EQOnly",
      "STOPPath=100",
      "GauMem = 1000",
      "GauProc = 4"
    ]
  },
  {
    "label": "MC-AFIR",
    "note": "ホルムアルデヒドとビニルアルコールの反応探索。座標末尾の整数はランダム配置する分子の区分です。人工力を加える原子団はFragm.で別途指定します。NSample = 10はAFIR経路10本で打ち切る例です。",
    "source": "https://afir.sci.hokudai.ac.jp/manual/grrm17/path-search-by-artificial-force-induced-reaction-method/grrm17_33.html",
    "lines": [
      "# MC-AFIR/B3LYP/6-31G*",
      "",
      "0 1",
      "C  0.000  0.000  0.000  1",
      "O  0.000  0.000  1.258  1",
      "H  0.934  0.000 -0.582  1",
      "H -0.934  0.000 -0.582  1",
      "C  4.000  0.000  0.000  2",
      "C  5.340  0.000  0.000  2",
      "O  3.330  1.180  0.000  2",
      "H  3.460 -0.935  0.000  2",
      "H  5.880 -0.935  0.000  2",
      "H  5.880  0.935  0.000  2",
      "H  2.380  1.040  0.000  2",
      "Options",
      "NSample = 10",
      "Add Interaction",
      "Fragm.1 = 1,2",
      "Fragm.2 = 5-7,11",
      "1 2",
      "GAMMA = 200",
      "END",
      "NOFC",
      "GauMem = 1000",
      "GauProc = 4"
    ]
  },
  {
    "label": "DS-AFIR",
    "note": "組成が同じ2つの構造を結ぶ経路探索。上段のホルムアルデヒドとReactantの下の構造で原子の順序をそろえます。",
    "source": "https://afir.sci.hokudai.ac.jp/manual/grrm17/path-search-by-artificial-force-induced-reaction-method/grrm17_39.html",
    "lines": [
      "# DS-AFIR/B3LYP/D95V(d)",
      "",
      "0 1",
      "C  0.000  0.000  0.000",
      "O  0.000  0.000  1.213",
      "H  0.942  0.000 -0.591",
      "H -0.942  0.000 -0.591",
      "Reactant",
      "C  0.000  0.000  0.000",
      "O  0.000  0.000  1.471",
      "H  0.816  0.000  2.042",
      "H -0.816 -0.001  2.042",
      "Options",
      "NOFC",
      "SaddleFC",
      "EigenCheck",
      "GauMem = 1000",
      "GauProc = 4"
    ]
  },
  {
    "label": "LUP",
    "note": "MC-AFIRで得た経路の最適化。実計算では、作業ディレクトリにある経路ログの名前を.logなしで%infileに指定し、原子数と順序をinfile先のログに合わせます。aldol_mc_PT0は参照するファイル名の例です。",
    "source": "https://afir.sci.hokudai.ac.jp/manual/grrm17/conventional-calculations/grrm17_15.html",
    "lines": [
      "%infile=aldol_mc_PT0",
      "# LUP/wB97XD/6-31G*",
      "",
      "0 1",
      "C  0.000  0.000  0.000",
      "O  0.000  0.000  1.258",
      "H  0.934  0.000 -0.582",
      "H -0.934  0.000 -0.582",
      "C  4.000  0.000  0.000",
      "C  5.340  0.000  0.000",
      "O  3.330  1.180  0.000",
      "H  3.460 -0.935  0.000",
      "H  5.880 -0.935  0.000",
      "H  5.880  0.935  0.000",
      "H  2.380  1.040  0.000",
      "Options",
      "NOFC",
      "SaddleFC",
      "EigenCheck",
      "GauMem = 1000",
      "GauProc = 4"
    ]
  },
  {
    "label": "MIN（SIESTA）",
    "note": "%linkでSIESTAを指定する水の構造最適化。実計算には同じジョブ名のSIESTA用.inpテンプレートと、使用する元素の擬ポテンシャルが必要です。",
    "source": "https://afir.sci.hokudai.ac.jp/manual/grrm17/interfaces-with-electronic-structure-calculation-programs/grrm17_47.html",
    "lines": [
      "%link=siesta-3.1",
      "# MIN",
      "",
      "0 1",
      "O  0.000  0.000  0.000",
      "H  0.758  0.000  0.504",
      "H -0.758  0.000  0.504",
      "Options",
      "NOFC",
      "SiestaProc = 2"
    ]
  }
]
